ison incremental rather than replacing the previous approach.\\n\",\"\\n\",\"### Baseline result from the previous completed run\\n\",\"\\n\",\"- Custom CNN test accuracy: **89.60%**\\n\",\"- Precision: **89.86%**\\n\",\"- Recall: **89.60%**\\n\",\"- Weighted F1-score: **89.65%**\\n\",\"- ResNet18 test accuracy: **83.09%**\\n\",\"\\n\",\"The new experiment below will be compared with the baseline Custom CNN.\"]},{\"cell_type\":\"markdown\",\"id\":\"1018f50d\",\"metadata\":{},\"source\":[\"## 17.1 Incremental Training Transform\\n\",\"\\n\",\"Only the crop scale is changed.  \\n\",\"The original course-level transform above remains unchanged.\"]},{\"cell_type\":\"code\",\"execution_count\":23,\"id\":\"bf5681bc\",\"metadata\":{},\"outputs\":[{\"name\":\"stdout\",\"output_type\":\"stream\",\"text\":[\"Baseline tuning epochs: 4\\n\",\"Incremental tuning epochs: 6\\n\",\"Final training epochs remain: 15\\n\"]}],\"source\":[\"incremental_train_transform = transforms.Compose([\\n\",\"    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(\\n\",\"        IMAGE_SIZE,\\n\",\"        scale=(0.8, 1.0)\\n\",\"    ),\\n\",\"    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(),\\n\",\"    transforms.ToTensor(),\\n\",\"    transforms.Normalize(mean, std)\\n\",\"])\\n\",\"\\n\",\"incremental_train_full = datasets.EuroSAT(\\n\",\"    root=DATA_DIR,\\n\",\"    transform=incremental_train_transform,\\n\",\"    download=False\\n\",\")\\n\",\"\\n\",\"incremental_train_dataset = Subset(\\n\",\"    incremental_train_full,\\n\",\"    train_indices\\n\",\")\\n\",\"\\n\",\"def make_incremental_loaders(batch_size):\\n\",\"    train_loader_incremental = DataLoader(\\n\",\"        incremental_train_dataset,\\n\",\"        batch_size=batch_size,\\n\",\"        shuffle=True,\\n\",\"        num_workers=0\\n\",\"    )\\n\",\"\\n\",\"    val_loader_incremental = DataLoader(\\n\",\"        val_dataset,\\n\",\"        batch_size=batch_size,\\n\",\"        shuffle=False,\\n\",\"        num_workers=0\\n\",\"    )\\n\",\"\\n\",\"    test_loader_incremental = DataLoader(\\n\",\"        test_dataset,\\n\",\"        batch_size=batch_size,\\n\",\"        shuffle=False,\\n\",\"        num_workers=0\\n\",\"    )\\n\",\"\\n\",\"    return (\\n\",\"        train_loader_incremental,\\n\",\"        val_loader_incremental,\\n\",\"        test_loader_incremental\\n\",\"    )\\n\",\"\\n\",\"INCREMENTAL_TUNING_EPOCHS = 6\\n\",\"INCREMENTAL_FINAL_EPOCHS = 15\\n\",\"\\n\",\"print(\\\"Baseline tuning epochs:\\\", TUNING_EPOCHS)\\n\",\"print(\\\"Incremental tuning epochs:\\\", INCREMENTAL_TUNING_EPOCHS)\\n\",\"print(\\\"Final training epochs remain:\\\", INCREMENTAL_FINAL_EPOCHS)\"]},{\"cell_type\":\"markdown\",\"id\":\"04ba124e\",\"metadata\":{},\"source\":[\"## 17.2 Run the Same Three Hyperparameter Experiments\\n\",\"\\n\",\"The hyperparameter combinations are exactly the same as the baseline.\\n\",\"Only the training transform and tuning duration are changed.\"]},{\"cell_type\":\"code\",\"execution_count\":24,\"id\":\"20bdfba4\",\"metadata\":{},\"outputs\":[{\"name\":\"stdout\",\"output_type\":\"stream\",\"text\":[\"\\n\",\"============================================================\\n\",\"Incremental - Experiment 1\\n\",\"==========================================================